  "baselineDelta": [
    "A replacement file-language registration is provisional: broker failure leaves the mounted language registry authoritative and cannot leak the rejected registration.",
    "The retired-control assertion waits for the lifecycle warning to reach the rendered terminal frame before checking it."
  ],
  "adaptations": [
    "Native extension startup is an asynchronous JSON-RPC event dispatched only after the replacement Ratatui registry, panes, command controls, review publication, and broker registration are committed.",
    "Rust extension discovery and handshakes are synchronous transactions with an explicit Loading/Closing/Closed authority. Retirement can revoke a delayed handshake from another thread, so late success cannot be adopted.",
    "Runtime replacement retires all old native children against one bounded deadline before emitting startup for the newly mounted registry; this removes the JavaScript promise interleaving while preserving observable lifecycle order.",
    "The VCS catalog is provider neutral and ranks the nearest detected checkout before built-in priority, including extension-only repository kinds and nested extension checkouts inside Git trees."
  ]
